# sitting's one ledger, every claim LABELED (logic/MIDDOT.md's codes; World/step9/CLAIM_LABELS.md), a machine check where the ink allows — every he_contains
# substring CUT FROM THE SNAPSHOT STORE'S OWN BYTES by the word's CONSONANTS (the longest piece whole, the floor four code points). Claim IDs DV17- and DV18-.
# Written once (no file may exist; the prefixes checked absent from every manifest and unit). Every source cite is checked against the ledger's CITE INDEX
# before a byte is written, and every CITE INDEX name must be used by a claim — the spine's 181 rows distributed by piska over the claims whose verses they
